.TH mull-reporter 1  "mull-reporter 0.0.0" 
.SH NAME
mull\-reporter \- Mull: mutation testing report generator
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmull\-reporter\fR [\fB\-\-reporters\fR] [\fB\-\-report\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-report\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-report\-patch\-base\fR] [\fB\-\-ide\-reporter\-show\-killed\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-surviving\fR] [\fB\-\-mutation\-score\-threshold\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-test\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-mutant\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-sqlite\-busy\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fISQLITE\-REPORT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mull: mutation testing report generator
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-reporters\fR \fI<REPORTER>\fR
Output reporters to use, more than one can be used at the same time
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
IDE: IDE\-friendly output with file:line:column format
.IP \(bu 2
SQLite: SQLite database for offline analysis
.IP \(bu 2
GitHubAnnotations: GitHub Actions annotation format
.IP \(bu 2
Patches: Generate patch files for each mutation
.IP \(bu 2
Elements: Mutation Testing Elements JSON/HTML report
.IP \(bu 2
Sarif: SARIF 2.1.0 report (Static Analysis Results Interchange Format)
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-report\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: .]
Directory for report output files
.TP
\fB\-\-report\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Filename for the report (only for supported reporters)
.TP
\fB\-\-report\-patch\-base\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: .]
Base directory for patch file paths
.TP
\fB\-\-ide\-reporter\-show\-killed\fR
Show killed mutations in IDE reporter output
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable debug mode with additional diagnostic output
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Treat warnings as fatal errors
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-surviving\fR
Do not treat surviving mutants as an error
.TP
\fB\-\-mutation\-score\-threshold\fR \fI<SCORE>\fR [default: 100]
Minimum mutation score (0\-100) required for success
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-test\-output\fR
Does not capture output from test runs
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-mutant\-output\fR
Does not capture output from mutant runs
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-output\fR
Combines \-\-no\-test\-output and \-\-no\-mutant\-output
.TP
\fB\-\-sqlite\-busy\-timeout\fR \fI<MS>\fR [default: 5000]
SQLite reporter busy timeout in milliseconds. When the database is locked by another writer, mull will retry for this long before giving up with "database is locked"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fISQLITE\-REPORT\fR>
Path to the sqlite report
.SH VERSION
v0.0.0
